<text >This is the “safe” or “cleansed” version of the absolute path to the note or container. If notes/containers might have problematical characters, such as slashes, then absolute references should use this string instead of $Path. Note that the Stamp “Safe Paths:Construct $SafePath for Note” can be used to update $SafePath for the selected Note. Also, the function “ConstructSafePath2Note(note)” will update $SafePath for the note supplied as the argument.
































</text>
