<text >Copies of essential Prototypes are staged in this container and will be copied to the “/Prototypes” container by the Installer, assuming there is not an existing Prototype with the same Name that is newer than the copy located here. The Installer will update the original Prototype for each moved Prototype copy. If any of the Prototype copies located here contain nested Prototypes, then special handling may be necessary.</text>
