<attribute name="Sentiments" >-0.4;-0.6;-1</attribute>
<attribute name="Subtitle" >Essentials</attribute>
<attribute name="Width" >3</attribute>
<attribute name="Xpos" >63</attribute>
<attribute name="Ypos" >0</attribute>
<text >Copies of essential Action Code that belong in the “/Hints/Library” container will be staged in this “Library Items” container. The Installer will move each of these items into “/Hints/Library” provided that there is not an existing item with the same name. If there does exist an item with the same name in “/Hints/Library,” then it will be checked to see if its Modified date is equal to or older than the item in this container, and if it is, then it will be moved to the Discards container and the newer item will replace it in “/Hints/Library.” The Installer will update each item moved into “/Hints/Stamps.”
Note that the “Document Commons” framework includes a “Function” Prototype derived from the “Action” Prototype. Each item copied by the Installer from this container into the “/Hints/Stamps” container will be assigned the “Function” Prototype. This will facilitate management of Package code.</text>
