<text >// This function provides a consistent method for obtaining the $ID 
// for any indexed “Document Commons” item. The supplied “commons_name”
// is a standardized name that may not match the $Name for the 
// corresponding actual Note. 

function GetCommonsItemID(commons_name)
{ 
  return($MyDictionary(lastSibling(cover))[commons_name]);
	//
}; // End of “GetCommonsItemID” definition

// This function relies upon the convention that a “Document Commons”
// container has been established as the last top-level note in
// outline order. By following this convention, the name of this
// container can be anything the user wants. 
// A version of this container can be copied into the user&apos;s document
// that will include automation to enforce it always being the last 
// top-level document note.
</text>
