<text >// Enter a special Bookmark into the log book for stamp actions

LogRec(&quot;StampLog&quot;,&quot;&lt;&lt;mark&gt;&gt;&quot;);

// The resulting bookmark record will look like this:
// ***** Bookmark: Index=00002: 22-05-19 12:34:07 *****
</text>
