<attribute name="Subtitle" >Diagram View</attribute>
<attribute name="Telephone" >+1 508 277-6439</attribute>
<attribute name="Xpos" >24.5</attribute>
<attribute name="Ypos" >0</attribute>
<text >The “Diagram Views” package is being provided in an initial form to allow interested users to try out this approach for adding diagrams to Tinderbox documents, and to determine interest in further improvements to this package and diagramming in general as a Tinderbox capability. 
Documentation for this package is built into the Toolbox document that serves as a vehicle for sharing this package, along with some other potentially useful packages. The best starting point for understanding what Diagram Views in Tinderbox can be used for, and how to work with them is provided in this note:
	/Document Commons/Packages/Diagram Views/Overview of Diagram Views Package with a quick tutorial and examples
Details on how to add this package to your own Tinderbox documents is provided here:
	/Document Commons/Packages/Diagram Views/Deploying Diagram package to existing Tinderbox document
The “Playground” top-level container includes a set of example notes that have been reflected into “Diagram A.” This would be a good place to start exploring how diagramming works with this package. Additional Diagram containers can be easily added to experiment with other examples of diagramming. 
Feedback is welcome. 
Chuck Wade &lt;Chuck@Interisle.net&gt; +1 508 277-6439
</text>
