<text >The “Diagram:Set Active Diagram” stamp will update pointers to the currently active Diagram based on the current selection. I.e., select the Diagram Container that should become the active Diagram and apply this stamp. The results for this “Diagram Settings” note will then be:
$MyString: Path to currently active Diagram Container
$MyNumber: ID of currently active Diagram Container
Once set, other actions can be performed on the active Diagram Container. For example, the “Diagram:Add Notes to Active Diagram” stamp will add the batch of currently selected notes to the active Diagram.</text>
