<text > 
When a note is added directly to a Diagram container, it does not reflect another note elsewhere in the same document. This can be a useful way to enhance a Diagram, so this option is fully supported. Such directly-added notes are given this “Diagram Object” prototype by the Diagram’s OnAdd action.  This makes it possible to track which notes are reflections of other notes, and which notes exist only in the Diagram. </text>
