<attribute name="Xpos" >10.5</attribute>
<attribute name="Ypos" >0</attribute>
<text >2025-01-30: This was fixed to handle creation of a reflection object note with the same name as some other note already in the diagram. However, while the new reflection object is created as expected, the CopyAttributeSet function is not able to perform the operation on the new reflection object.  For some reason, attributes do not seem to exist for this new reflection object.
</text>
