<text >Copies of Action code notes that belong in the “/Hints” container should be placed here. The Installer will move them to “/Hints” assuming that there is not already an existing Action code note with the same Name that is newer than the copy located here. If there is an existing Action code note that is older (or the same), it will be moved to “/Document Commons/Discards/Hints Actions” so that it is not deleted. However, the new version moved from this container will replace the existing item. The user can delete Discard items manually if desired.</text>
