<attribute name="MyDictionary" >category:User;sequential:;lines:1;readonly:;type:set;description:Attributes that should not be copied from the original Reflected note to a corresponding Reflection note are listed in this set. This allows select attributes to be decoupled from the original without having any impact on the original. For example, if &quot;Shape&quot; was included in this set, then the shape of a Reflection Object could be changed while the Reflected note retains its original shape.




































;suggested:[AccentColor;Badge;BadgeMonochrome;BadgeSize;Base;Bend;Border;BorderBevel;BorderColor;BorderDash;Caption;CaptionAlignment;CaptionColor;CaptionFont;CaptionOpacity;CaptionSize;ClusterTerms;Color;Direction;Flags;NameAlignment;NameBold;NameColor;NameFont;NameLeading;NameOpacity;NameStrike;NameVerticalAlignment;Opacity;Pattern;PlotColor;Shadow;ShadowBlur;ShadowColor;ShadowDistance;Shape;Stripe;StripeColor;Subtitle;SubtitleColor;SubtitleOpacity;SubtitleSize;TextBackgroundColor;Tip;TitleOpacity];default:</attribute>
