<attribute name="Subtitle" >set</attribute>
<attribute name="Xpos" >80.5</attribute>
<attribute name="Ypos" >0</attribute>
<text >Attributes that should not be copied from the original Reflected note to a corresponding Reflection note are listed in this set. This allows select attributes to be decoupled from the original without having any impact on the original. For example, if &quot;Shape&quot; was included in this set, then the shape of a Reflection Object could be changed while the Reflected note retains its original shape.





































</text>
</item>
