<attribute name="Ypos" >0</attribute>
<text >This dictionary is maintained in a Diagram Container and used to lookup $ID for a reflection-object child in the diagram given the $ID of the reflected note. One use for this dictionary is periodically updating reflections and links and performing maintenance of a diagram&apos;s objects.






































</text>
</item>
