<text >Copies of essential Templates are kept in this container and will be copied to the “/Templates” container by the Installer, assuming there is not an existing Template with the same Name that is newer than the copy located here. The Installer will reset the original Template for each moved Template copy. If any of the Template copies located here contain nested Templates, then special handling may be necessary.</text>
