<attribute name="Subtitle" >Diagram View</attribute>
<attribute name="Xpos" >150.5</attribute>
<attribute name="Ypos" >0</attribute>
<text >This container includes notes and containers that will establish Link types when copied and pasted into other documents (at least, that’s the idea).
At this time, it is still necessary to use the Inspector to manually configure these two link types: 
	•	Diagram←Note Add this string to the “Action” field:    action($Text(&quot;/Hints/Link «Reflect Note into Diagram»&quot;)); and also uncheck “visible” and “labeled”
	•	Diagram_Reflection→Note uncheck  “visible” and “labeled”
</text>
