<text >This mostly seems to be working, including when duplicated names are removed. There may still be some edge cases that crop up when removing reflection notes from a diagram.</text>
<rtfd >cnRmZAAAAAADAAAAAgAAAAcAAABUWFQucnRmAQAAAC7mAQAAKwAAAAEAAADeAQAAe1xydGYxXGFuc2lcYW5zaWNwZzEyNTJcY29jb2FydGYyNzA5Clxjb2NvYXRleHRzY2FsaW5nMFxjb2NvYXBsYXRmb3JtMHtcZm9udHRibFxmMFxmbmlsXGZjaGFyc2V0MCBNZXJjdXJ5U1NtLUJvb2s7fQp7XGNvbG9ydGJsO1xyZWQyNTVcZ3JlZW4yNTVcYmx1ZTI1NTtccmVkMFxncmVlbjBcYmx1ZTA7fQp7XCpcZXhwYW5kZWRjb2xvcnRibDs7XGNzcHRocmVlXGMwXGMwXGMwO30KXHBhcmRcdHgzNjBcdHg3MjBcdHgxMDgwXHR4MTQ0MFxzYjgwXHNhODBccGFyZGlybmF0dXJhbFxwYXJ0aWdodGVuZmFjdG9yMAoKXGYwXGZzMzIgXGNmMiBUaGlzIG1vc3RseSBzZWVtcyB0byBiZSB3b3JraW5nLCBpbmNsdWRpbmcgd2hlbiBkdXBsaWNhdGVkIG5hbWVzIGFyZSByZW1vdmVkLiBUaGVyZSBtYXkgc3RpbGwgYmUgc29tZSBlZGdlIGNhc2VzIHRoYXQgY3JvcCB1cCB3aGVuIHJlbW92aW5nIHJlZmxlY3Rpb24gbm90ZXMgZnJvbSBhIGRpYWdyYW0ufQEAAAAjAAAAAQAAAAcAAABUWFQucnRmEAAAAEtvv2e2AQAAAAAAAAAAAAA=</rtfd>
