<item ID="1744855896" Creator="Chuck Wade" proto="Task" >
<attribute name="Created" >2025-03-03T14:46:19+09:00</attribute>
<attribute name="DisplayedAttributes" >Subtitle;Creator;Modified;StartDate;EndDate</attribute>
<attribute name="DominantLanguage" >en</attribute>
<attribute name="EndDate" >2025-03-03T14:47:13+09:00</attribute>
<attribute name="Height" >1.86</attribute>
<attribute name="Modified" >2025-03-03T14:56:52+09:00</attribute>
<attribute name="Name" >Provide a mechanism for adding multiple notes to a diagram at once</attribute>
<attribute name="SelectionCount" >16</attribute>
<attribute name="Sentiment" >-0.5200000048</attribute>
<attribute name="Sentiments" >0;-1;-0.8;-0.8;0</attribute>
<attribute name="StartDate" >2025-03-02T14:46:53+09:00</attribute>
<attribute name="Subtitle" >Diagram View</attribute>
<attribute name="Width" >3</attribute>
<attribute name="Xpos" >21</attribute>
<attribute name="Ypos" >0</attribute>
<text >Provide some mechanism to add multiple notes to a diagram in bulk. Ideally, the user could select (e.g., via Cmd-click) multiple notes within their document, and then apply a stamp to add them to a diagram. This would entail having some means to also specify which diagram should receive the reflected notes.
3/3/25 14:50 An initial implementation has been provided in the form of two stamps. 
	•	Diagram:Set Active Diagram This utilizes a new “Global Settings” note named “Diagram Settings” that currently just keeps track of what the currently active Diagram is. This allows other stamps or functions to perform a priori updates to this active diagram.
	•	Diagram:Add Notes to Active Diagram Whatever notes are currently selected will be added to the currently active Diagram (see above). This can be embellished in the future to offer some customization of how the selected notes are added. 
</text>
<rtfd >cnRmZAAAAAADAAAAAgAAAAcAAABUWFQucnRmAQAAAC7hBgAAKwAAAAEAAADZBgAAe1xydGYxXGFuc2lcYW5zaWNwZzEyNTJcY29jb2FydGYyNzA5Clxjb2NvYXRleHRzY2FsaW5nMFxjb2NvYXBsYXRmb3JtMHtcZm9udHRibFxmMFxmbmlsXGZjaGFyc2V0MCBNZXJjdXJ5U1NtLUJvb2s7fQp7XGNvbG9ydGJsO1xyZWQyNTVcZ3JlZW4yNTVcYmx1ZTI1NTtccmVkMFxncmVlbjBcYmx1ZTA7fQp7XCpcZXhwYW5kZWRjb2xvcnRibDs7XGNzcHRocmVlXGMwXGMwXGMwO30Ke1wqXGxpc3R0YWJsZXtcbGlzdFxsaXN0dGVtcGxhdGVpZDFcbGlzdGh5YnJpZHtcbGlzdGxldmVsXGxldmVsbmZjMjNcbGV2ZWxuZmNuMjNcbGV2ZWxqYzBcbGV2ZWxqY24wXGxldmVsZm9sbG93MFxsZXZlbHN0YXJ0YXQxXGxldmVsc3BhY2UzNjBcbGV2ZWxpbmRlbnQwe1wqXGxldmVsbWFya2VyIFx7ZGlzY1x9fXtcbGV2ZWx0ZXh0XGxldmVsdGVtcGxhdGVpZDFcJzAxXHVjMFx1ODIyNiA7fXtcbGV2ZWxudW1iZXJzO31cZmktMzYwXGxpNzIwXGxpbjcyMCB9e1xsaXN0bmFtZSA7fVxsaXN0aWQxfX0Ke1wqXGxpc3RvdmVycmlkZXRhYmxle1xsaXN0b3ZlcnJpZGVcbGlzdGlkMVxsaXN0b3ZlcnJpZGVjb3VudDBcbHMxfX0KXHBhcmRcdHgzNjBcdHg3MjBcdHgxMDgwXHR4MTQ0MFxzYjgwXHNhODBccGFyZGlybmF0dXJhbFxwYXJ0aWdodGVuZmFjdG9yMAoKXGYwXGZzMzIgXGNmMiBQcm92aWRlIHNvbWUgbWVjaGFuaXNtIHRvIGFkZCBtdWx0aXBsZSBub3RlcyB0byBhIGRpYWdyYW0gaW4gYnVsay4gSWRlYWxseSwgdGhlIHVzZXIgY291bGQgc2VsZWN0IChlLmcuLCB2aWEgQ21kLWNsaWNrKSBtdWx0aXBsZSBub3RlcyB3aXRoaW4gdGhlaXIgZG9jdW1lbnQsIGFuZCB0aGVuIGFwcGx5IGEgc3RhbXAgdG8gYWRkIHRoZW0gdG8gYSBkaWFncmFtLiBUaGlzIHdvdWxkIGVudGFpbCBoYXZpbmcgc29tZSBtZWFucyB0byBhbHNvIHNwZWNpZnkgd2hpY2ggZGlhZ3JhbSBzaG91bGQgcmVjZWl2ZSB0aGUgcmVmbGVjdGVkIG5vdGVzLlwKMy8zLzI1IDE0OjUwIEFuIGluaXRpYWwgaW1wbGVtZW50YXRpb24gaGFzIGJlZW4gcHJvdmlkZWQgaW4gdGhlIGZvcm0gb2YgdHdvIHN0YW1wcy4gXApccGFyZFx0eDIyMFx0eDcyMFx0eDEwODBcdHgxNDQwXGxpNzIwXGZpLTcyMFxzYjgwXHNhODBccGFyZGlybmF0dXJhbFxwYXJ0aWdodGVuZmFjdG9yMApcbHMxXGlsdmwwXGNmMiB7XGxpc3R0ZXh0CVx1YzBcdTgyMjYgCX1EaWFncmFtOlNldCBBY3RpdmUgRGlhZ3JhbVx1YzBcdTgyMzIgVGhpcyB1dGlsaXplcyBhIG5ldyBcJzkzR2xvYmFsIFNldHRpbmdzXCc5NCBub3RlIG5hbWVkIFwnOTNEaWFncmFtIFNldHRpbmdzXCc5NCB0aGF0IGN1cnJlbnRseSBqdXN0IGtlZXBzIHRyYWNrIG9mIHdoYXQgdGhlIGN1cnJlbnRseSAKXGkgYWN0aXZlIERpYWdyYW0KXGkwICBpcy4gVGhpcyBhbGxvd3Mgb3RoZXIgc3RhbXBzIG9yIGZ1bmN0aW9ucyB0byBwZXJmb3Jt